  "text_md": "<!-- image -->\n\nThe official monthly magazine of the SA Department of Defence\n\n- 4 From the Editor's desk\n- 5 End of an era for the Executive National Security Programme\n- 6 Letters to the editor\n- 10 South Africa assists Mozambique Government during the floods\n- 12 Mandela Commemoration Medal Parade\n- 16 Chief SANDF bestows medals for first-class service to the SANDF\n- National Civic 18 Remembrance Sunday and Wreath-laying Ceremony\n- SA observes 20 the 96t anniversary of Armistice Army Day\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSTREET ADDRESS Defence Headquarters cor Nossob &amp; Boeing St Erasmuskloof PRETORIA\n\nPOSTAL ADDRESS SA SOLDIER Private X158 PRETORIA, 0001 Bag\n\n## TELEPHONE\n\nwebsite: www.dod.mil.za\n\nTel: (012) 355 6341 Fax: (012) 355 6399 email:sasoldier@mil za\n\n- 22 Future Armour Capability Conference\n- 24 Training Command bids farewell to its General Officer Commanding\n- 25 Graduation ceremony of the Joint Senior Command and Staff Programme\n- Chief Human Resources 26 honours his loyal members\n- 28 7th Warrant Officers' Academy Certificate Ceremony\n- Military Academy 29 awarded its students who excelled\n- 30 Mitchells Plain Festival\n- 32 Preparing SA youth for a nautical career\n- 34 A visit to Air Force Base Ysterplaat Museum\n- Retire or resign with GEPF: What need 36 to know you\n- 39 Johannesburg Regiments Association exercises its Freedom of Entry in Soweto\n- 40 The DOD participates in Chief SANDF Prestige Week\n- Diseases of lifestyle 42 pose a threat to the development of SA\n- 43 Embracing our colleagues with disabilities\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## CONTRIBUTIONS:\n\nAlthough all possible care is taken with articles; the editorial staff cannot accept any responsibility for lost articles and photographs.\n\n## REPRODUCTION, PRINTING &amp; DISTRIBUTION:\n\nFormeset Print (Pty) Ltd 24 Kinghall Avenue EPPINGDUST, Cape Town, 7460 Tel: (021) 507 9000 Fax: (021) 506 9092 email: formeset@formeset.co.za\n\n2005 Winner of the Government